{
  "slug": "github-talent-mcp",
  "name": "Github Talent Mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "MCP server for technical recruiting. Search GitHub developers by language, location, and activity. Get deep profiles with activity scores (commits, PRs, stars, OSS contributions). Rank candidates against job descriptions with combined activity + relevance scoring. 4 tools: search_developers, get_developer_profile, rank_candidates, get_repo_contributors.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `github-talent`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install github-talent-mcp@claude-community` from `carolinacherry/github-talent-mcp`.\n\nMCP server that searches, scores, and ranks GitHub developers for technical recruiting.\n\nMCP server for technical recruiting. Search GitHub developers by language, location, and activity. Get deep profiles with activity scores (commits, PRs, stars, OSS contributions). Rank candidates against job descriptions with combined activity + relevance scoring. 4 tools: search_developers, get_developer_profile, rank_candidates, get_repo_contributors.",
